==================== Branch work275, patch #1 ====================

Add extra debug support.

This patch adds debug switches -mdebug=extra1 through -mdebug=extra5.

The patch also prints additional information about the various floating
point formats used for the different modes.

2026-11-16  Michael Meissner  <meissner@linux.ibm.com>

gcc/

	* gcc/common/config/rs6000/rs6000-common.cc (rs6000_handle_option): Add
	-mdebug=extra{1,2,3,4,5}.
	* config/rs6000/rs6000.h (MASK_DEBUG_*): Likewise.
	(TARGET_DEBUG_*): Likewise.
	* config/rs6000/rs6000.cc (rs6000_debug_fp_mode): New debug function.
	(rs6000_debug_reg_global): If -mdebug=reg, print extra information about
	the various floating point formats used.

